 build system (fast, efficient) instead of Make.\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n```\nOptimize for performance (enables `-O3`-level optimizations, strips debug info).\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIBDIR=lib\n```\n- **Install prefix**: where files will be installed (`/usr`).\n- **Install libdir**: libraries go in `/usr/lib` (important for 64-bit systems).\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=icx"}